bsp; 아래와 같이 안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>신청 기간 : 2013.05.23.(목)~05.27.(월)</u></strong></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">신청 장소</span></u></strong></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 가. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">복수전공 및 부전공 해당 “종합학사행정실</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">”</span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 나. 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유(날인)한 후</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 복수전공(변경)/부전공 학부장에게 제출</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>신청 서류 : 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부.</u></strong></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 참고사항</span></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 가. 복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는&nbsp;</span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">이수 성적이&nbsp;</span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">평점평균 </span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.00이상 이어야 합니다.</span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 나. 복수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우&nbsp;</span></font></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로</span></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 인정하며,&nbsp;</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는&nbsp;</font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">부전공학점으로</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 인정합니다.</span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 다. </span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#050099\">졸업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 되었으나,</font></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#050099\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 합니다.</font></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></font></p><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: